{
  "about": "Tests whose input is the checked-in tree itself (#2681). Each entry splits into rule files (the test, the code or tool that does the walk, and any expected-set file) and the scope the walk reads. Two branches that touch disjoint files still break when one changes a rule file and the other changes a path in that entry's scope (#2642 + #2632). tools/repo_scans.py judges a pull request against the tip with this table; tests/repo_scans_test.py keeps the table complete.",
